{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "管教一词的希腊文词源", "content": "管教一词源自希腊文disciple，意为门徒。门徒跟随师傅同吃同住，不仅聆听教诲，还观察师傅的作为和做事方法。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["管教", "词源", "门徒"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-60149f80fd1e", "blocks": ["b00009", "b00010"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a002", "kind": "supports", "condition": "管教的核心在于管理自己，因为门徒跟随师傅同吃同住，观察师傅的作为。", "reason": "词源表明门徒通过观察师傅学习，因此父母作为榜样必须管理自己。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "legacy:gj-c-01", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：理解管教词源中门徒含义；区别：旧原子将词源与‘先管理自己’结论结合，候选仅解释词源本身", "reason": "补充希腊文词源细节，但未覆盖管理自己的结论。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-60149f80fd1e-c001:u05"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "管教的核心在于管理自己", "content": "管教孩子首先要管理自己。父母自己管理不好生活，孩子就很难受教。孩子会模仿父母的言行举止、为人处事和脾性。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["管教", "自我管理", "榜样"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a002", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-60149f80fd1e", "blocks": ["b00013", "b00017"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a008", "kind": "supports", "condition": "孩子模仿父母，所以父母管理自己是管教的前提。", "reason": "a002强调父母管理自己，a008解释孩子模仿父母，两者共同支持榜样作用。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a012", "kind": "causes", "condition": "父母没有管理好自己的生活，导致孩子不受教。", "reason": "a012明确指出孩子不受教是因为父母自身管理不善，与a002的自我管理要求一致。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "legacy:gj-c-01", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "共同适用：管教孩子时、孩子不受教时都需要先管理自己；区别：候选无明确条件，旧原子有条件限定‘孩子不受教而父母只顾盯着孩子改’", "reason": "核心命题‘管教孩子首先要管理自己’等价，候选表述更简洁。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:gj-ca-01", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "共同适用：管教孩子前先管理自己；legacy 限制不适用于父母已管理好自身、孩子问题另有他因。", "reason": "对应核心原则“管教的核心在于管理自己”。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:n12-c-19", "kind": "complements", "condition": "都强调父母榜样作用；旧原子要求父母遇挫不甩锅、话锋一转找出口。", "reason": "阐述管教核心是管理自己，孩子会模仿父母言行处事，为旧原子榜样传递提供基础。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-60149f80fd1e-c001:u07"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "管教的目的在于引导赋能而非控制", "content": "管教不在于控制孩子，而在于引导孩子赋能。管教的目的是让孩子最终能够独立，不需要被他人管着和监督。因为父母总有管不住孩子的一天，比如孩子去国外读书、长大毕业，已经管不住他；到那时孩子能够自己管理自己。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["管教", "目的", "独立"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a003", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-60149f80fd1e", "blocks": ["b00027", "b00029"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a013", "kind": "supports", "condition": "管教目的是让孩子独立", "reason": "“管教的目的在于引导赋能而非控制”中的独立目标，支持“管教目标：孩子越大越不需要管”的具体表述。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a016", "kind": "supports", "condition": "管教不是控制而是引导", "reason": "“管教的目的在于引导赋能而非控制”与“管教与控制的区别”都强调引导而非控制，前项支持后项对两者区分的阐释。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a016", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:u15", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "legacy:gj-c-01", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：完整的管教观包括引导赋能；区别：旧原子限制中提及‘管教不限于身教，还有引导与赋能’，候选专门阐述管教目的是引导赋能而非控制", "reason": "补充旧原子限制中提到的引导赋能面向。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:gj-c-02", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "共同适用：判断管教方向/目的时；均不限特定年龄段。", "reason": "内容基本等价：均表述管教不在于控制，而在于引导赋能，目标是孩子最终独立、能自我管理，父母总有管不住的一天，孩子越大越不需要被管。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-60149f80fd1e-c001:u15"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "管教如疏通管道", "content": "管教就像一团乱七八糟的水堵住时，挖一个管子让水顺着管子流通出去，引导顺畅。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["管教", "比喻", "引导"], "evidence": "metaphor", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a004", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-60149f80fd1e", "blocks": ["b00024"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a003", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "疏通管道的比喻说明管教是引导而非控制", "reason": "“管教如疏通管道”的比喻形象地说明了“管教的目的在于引导赋能而非控制”中的引导含义。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}], "knowledge_units": ["s-60149f80fd1e-c001:u13"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "管教需要有意义", "content": "对孩子的管教一定要有意义。如果管教没有意义，不管付出多少心血都是勉强顶上去的。就像孩子学习没有意义学不好，工作没有意义不会好好工作，生活没有意义会成为躺平青年而非积极向上的青年。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["管教", "意义"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a005", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-60149f80fd1e", "blocks": ["b00025", "b00026"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a006", "kind": "supports", "condition": "管教需要有意义，且凭直觉经验无科学支持", "reason": "“管教需要有意义”支持“凭直觉和经验的管教出错几率大”的观点，因为直觉经验缺乏科学支持，难以保证管教有意义。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}], "knowledge_units": ["s-60149f80fd1e-c001:u14"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "凭直觉和经验的管教出错几率大", "content": "很多父母面对精密且随年龄不断变化的孩子，凭直觉或凭自己父母管教自己的经验来管教孩子，没有科学支持，这种管教方式是错误的，出错几率很大。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["管教", "直觉", "经验", "科学"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a006", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-60149f80fd1e", "blocks": ["b00003", "b00004", "b00006"], "source_kind": "A1"}, {"source_id": "s-60149f80fd1e", "blocks": ["b00003", "b00004", "b00006", "b00009"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a007", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "两种原始管教态度都是凭直觉和经验的例子。", "reason": "a007列举两种未经学习验证的态度，是a006所指凭直觉和经验的具体表现。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a015", "kind": "supports", "condition": "吃泥巴治病的比喻说明凭个人经验不可信。", "reason": "a015用比喻论证凭经验不可信，支持a006的观点。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}], "knowledge_units": ["s-60149f80fd1e-c001:u02"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "distinction", "title": "两种原始管教态度", "content": "一种态度是认为孩子从小被打过来也没事，所以可以打孩子；另一种态度是坚决不打孩子，因为对过去被打深恶痛绝。这两种都是没有经过学习和验证的原始方法。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["管教", "体罚", "态度"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": ["涉及体罚，需谨慎对待，不可作为普遍结论"], "id": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a007", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-60149f80fd1e", "blocks": ["b00004", "b00005", "b00006"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-60149f80fd1e-c001:u03"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "孩子模仿父母行为", "content": "孩子每天与父母住在一起，聆听教诲，观察所作所为、为人处事，学习脾性，所以孩子很像父母。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["模仿", "榜样", "家庭影响"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a008", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-60149f80fd1e", "blocks": ["b00011", "b00012", "b00013"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a009", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "电梯里父亲抽烟骂孩子案例说明孩子模仿父母行为。", "reason": "a009是a008所述孩子模仿父母的具体案例。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a010", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "女客人成长经历说明家庭环境对孩子行为的深远影响。", "reason": "a010展示孩子受母亲行为影响，是a008模仿概念的极端案例。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a011", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "家庭暴力代际传递说明孩子模仿暴力行为。", "reason": "a011是a008所述模仿行为的体现。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-60149f80fd1e-c001:u06"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "电梯里父亲抽烟骂孩子案例", "content": "讲师在中国讲座时，在电梯里看到一对父子，孩子约十二三岁，因偷偷抽烟被爸爸骂。但爸爸走出电梯后自己从包里掏出烟抽。讲师认为父亲自己抽烟却骂孩子，孩子怎么可能不抽烟。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["案例", "抽烟", "榜样", "父子"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a009", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-60149f80fd1e", "blocks": ["b00015", "b00016"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "legacy:gj-ca-01", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "共同适用：父母自身有同样问题却要求孩子改变；legacy 另有“不适用于父母已管理好自身”的限制，候选未提。", "reason": "同一案例：父亲电梯里骂孩子抽烟后自己抽烟。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-60149f80fd1e-c001:u09"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "女客人成长经历与情妇职业案例", "content": "讲师的一位女客人从小父母离婚，跟着妈妈生活。妈妈不断换男朋友并带回家住，男人来了又走。女孩长大后成为职业情妇，妈妈骂她不要脸，女孩服药自杀，留下信说从小看见的生活就是如此，长大了要靠什么力量摆脱。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["案例", "家庭影响", "情妇", "自杀"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": ["涉及自杀，需谨慎对待，不可作为普遍结论"], "id": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a010", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-60149f80fd1e", "blocks": ["b00018", "b00019", "b00020", "b00021", "b00022"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-60149f80fd1e-c001:u11"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "家庭暴力代际传递", "content": "孩子从小看见爸爸打妈妈，女儿后来找的老公可能会打她；儿子以后娶了喜欢的太太，一生气也可能会打太太。从小看到的行为根深蒂固，很难跳脱。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["家庭暴力", "代际传递", "模仿"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": ["涉及家庭暴力，需谨慎对待，不可作为普遍结论"], "id": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a011", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-60149f80fd1e", "blocks": ["b00022", "b00023"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-60149f80fd1e-c001:u12"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "父母不管理自己导致孩子不受教", "content": "孩子不受教，说一句顶十句，是因为父母自己本身没有管理好自己的生活，婚姻家庭一塌糊涂，却希望孩子听话，这是不太可能的。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["管教", "自我管理", "亲子关系"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a012", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-60149f80fd1e", "blocks": ["b00017"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "legacy:gj-c-01", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：父母自身管理混乱导致孩子不受教；区别：旧原子提出先管理自己，候选指出具体表现‘说一句顶十句、婚姻家庭一塌糊涂’", "reason": "补充父母不管理自己的具体后果，支撑旧原子判断。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:gj-ca-01", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "共同适用：父母自身生活没管理好导致孩子不受教；legacy 附加限制。", "reason": "直接对应“孩子不受教根源在父母不管理自己”。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-60149f80fd1e-c001:u10"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "管教目标：孩子越大越不需要管", "content": "管教的目的是孩子越大越不需要管，因为孩子自己能按照好的正常方向做事。如果父母一直在背后追着管，如追着孩子处理摔杯子、洒牛奶、过马路等，会越来越累，孩子越大越管不住，导致焦虑抑郁和亲子矛盾。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["管教", "独立", "亲子关系"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a013", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-60149f80fd1e", "blocks": ["b00029", "b00030", "b00031"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a014", "kind": "prerequisite", "condition": "孩子能管理自己是因为知道行为后果。", "reason": "a013提出孩子越大越不需要管，a014解释孩子能管理自己的原因是知道后果。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "legacy:gj-c-02", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：评估管教长期目标时。", "reason": "补充了“孩子越大越不需要管”的具体后果：若父母一直追着管会越来越累、孩子越大越管不住，并导致焦虑抑郁和亲子矛盾。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-60149f80fd1e-c001:u17"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
