{"type": "concept", "subtype": "metaphor", "title": "吃泥巴治病的比喻", "content": "讲师用吃泥巴治病的比喻说明凭个人经验管教孩子不可信：就像有人说自己摔倒吃泥巴病好了，让你也去吃泥巴，你不会相信，但很多人却凭直觉和经验教孩子。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["比喻", "经验", "不可信"], "evidence": "metaphor", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a015", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-60149f80fd1e", "blocks": ["b00007", "b00008", "b00009"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-60149f80fd1e-c001:u04"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "distinction", "title": "管教与控制的区别", "content": "管教不在于控制孩子，而在于引导孩子赋能。控制是每天在背后追着孩子，而引导是让孩子最终独立。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["管教", "控制", "引导"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a016", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-60149f80fd1e", "blocks": ["b00027", "b00029"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:r001", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "管教不是控制，但很多人一想到管教就出现对立画面。", "reason": "r001描述常见的管教画面是控制和对立，与a016的引导理念形成对比。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:a003", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-60149f80fd1e-c001:u15", "evidence": "point_source_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-60149f80fd1e-c001:u15"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
